          "content": "Horizon Bank currently supports domestic transfers denominated in Singapore dollars (SGD). We do not handle foreign-currency transfers or cross-border payments. Domestic transfers are sent instantly with immediate confirmation, though the recipient's bank may need additional time to settle the transaction."
        },
