          "title": "Transfer Limits and Payees",
          "content": "For PayNow or FAST payments to added beneficiaries, each transaction may be up to {{faq_6f4ef9e6_001}}, with a total daily ceiling of {{faq_6f4ef9e6_002}}. For PayNow to recipients not saved in your payee list, the default daily limit is {{faq_6f4ef9e6_003}}, and exceeding this amount requires verification using the Horizon Key. For payments up to {{faq_5f44e56e_001}}, you can send funds instantly without adding a recipient as a payee."
        },
